{"channelId":"UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","row":["Venn Healthcare Ltd",52600,"Supplying the UK's medical and aesthetic markets with the latest non-invasive medical and cosmetic treatments from trusted global brands, Storz Medical, Classys, Cluederm, Lutronic & Aquagold Fine Touch. Training and in-house after care provided. \n\nAbout Us\nVenn Healthcare supply advanced, non-invasive systems for medical, cosmetic and aesthetic markets. Our product portfolio includes carefully selected treatments from trusted global brands Product lines include a wide range of devices with various applications from dermatological applications such as HIFU, Fat Freezing, skin tightening, laser tattoo and hair removal to the treatment of soft tissue injuries and urological pathologies. Technologies vary from the latest fat freezing and laser machines to shockwave therapy devices and micro needling. \n\nClients include clinicians and physiotherapists to clinic owners and hospital managers, this give us a deeper understanding of both client and practitioner needs. www.vennhealthcare.com","info@vennhealthcare.com","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:44.201Z","channelId":"UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"d1166d4162a83400857fc086a95f0e10b8c43b64fe8241a84d1ce0fead871d72","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e8110b051d8a2508185e15fd6417a944bac5180d1ab1b827d05304d9a683bbb4"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:44.201Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":52600,"raw":"52.6K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UClmAthKrrYLxh67cD7Cuv7A","observe